- the WALK carrier replacing the report is still a named deviation (Q-016, #310);
- list-first matches Q-273;
- R-004 as a loop run rests on Q-275, as the design cites it.

Every agreed criterion now has a case whose trigger can reach its shape:
- T-010: criteria 1, 2, 3, 4 (general) and 6 (in-window), plus 7's view switch and rescan;
- T-011: criteria 4 (cut) and 5;
- R-004: criterion 6's landing;
- T-003: the completed-path open;
- StoppedTreeOfferTests: the offer guard and the disjointness of not-listed and unreadable.

The one gap is run 3's second-ending checks, which have no log line to read (m1).
